                                                "sense_id": "9aa41e7d-302e-36b2-bff0-bbdc2d7ee4c1",
                                                "text": "A man's one-piece swimsuit can be as small as a jock strap, whereas a woman's one-piece swimsuit covers both the genitalia and the breasts."
